{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnofflinestorage\/invalidatepack:withcompletionhandler:"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflineStorage(im)invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Invalidates the specified offline pack. This method checks that the tiles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the specified offline pack match those from the server. Local tiles that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"do not match the latest version on the server are updated.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"invalidatePack:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflinePack","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MLNOfflinePack","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNOfflinePack"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"pack"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCompletionHandler:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":" (^)("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError"},{"kind":"text","text":" *"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":""},{"kind":"text","text":")) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"completion"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"pack","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The offline pack to be invalidated.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"completion","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The completion handler to call once the pack has been","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"marked for revalidation in offline storage, or an error occurs. This handler is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"executed asynchronously on the main queue.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is more efficient than deleting the offline pack and downloading it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again. If the data stored locally matches that on the server, new data will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not be downloaded."}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage/invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage\/invalidatePack:withCompletionHandler:","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Invalidates the specified offline pack. This method checks that the tiles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in t